  "translate_en|mods/FieldMedicine/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Tooltip.json|Tooltip_FM_Bandage": "Bandages one injured body part like a normal bandage and stops its bleeding. Double-click to treat the most urgent wound, or right-click the item or a body part in the health panel to choose.",
  "translate_en|mods/FieldMedicine/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Tooltip.json|Tooltip_FM_MedkitAll": "Restores health and treats every wound on a body part: bleeding, serious wounds, fractures, scratches, bite wounds, infection and muscle strain. Does not treat burns or zombie infection. Heavier treatments use more charge and make you hungrier and thirstier. Double-click to treat every wound first and then heal, or right-click the item or a body part in the health panel to choose.",
  "translate_en|mods/FieldMedicine/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Tooltip.json|Tooltip_FM_MedkitBleed": "Restores health, stops bleeding and treats scratches and bite wounds (not the zombie infection). Heavier treatments use more charge and make you hungrier and thirstier. Double-click to treat every wound first and then heal, or right-click the item or a body part in the health panel to choose.",
  "translate_en|mods/FieldMedicine/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Tooltip.json|Tooltip_FM_MedkitHealth": "Restores health and treats scratches and bite wounds (not the zombie infection). Heavier treatments use more charge and make you hungrier and thirstier. Double-click to treat every wound first and then heal, or right-click the item or a body part in the health panel to choose.",
  "translate_en|mods/FieldMedicine/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Tooltip.json|Tooltip_FM_Splint": "Fully heals one fracture per use, then bandages the body part. Double-click to treat the most urgent wound, or right-click the item or a body part in the health panel to choose.",
  "translate_en|mods/FieldMedicine/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Tooltip.json|Tooltip_FM_SurgKit": "Stitches one deep wound or laceration per use, taking out a lodged bullet or glass shards first, then bandages it. The wound heals over time. Stop the bleeding first. Does not treat fractures, burns or infection. Double-click to treat the most urgent wound, or right-click the item or a body part in the health panel to choose.",
  "translate_en|mods/FieldMedicine/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Tooltip.json|Tooltip_FM_Tourniquet": "Stops the bleeding on one body part. Does not bandage or heal the wound. Double-click to treat the most urgent wound, or right-click the item or a body part in the health panel to choose."
}
